## 2. STRICT DATA INTEGRITY PRINCIPLES

Every finding, metric, and analytical conclusion throughout the platform displays its verified status tier:

| Data Badge | Color Code | Methodological Definition |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **VERIFIED** | Emerald Green | Information obtained directly from primary credible sources (audited reports, government registries, DRAP certifications). |
| **CALCULATED** | Cyan Blue | Information mathematically derived from verified or known parameters (e.g. employee-to-revenue ratios). |
| **ESTIMATED** | Amber Orange | Reasonable industry benchmark estimates based on available empirical evidence. |
| **ANALYTICAL** | Indigo Purple | Strategic conclusions, potential scores, and AI models produced by the intelligence engine. |

Major findings also carry explicit **Confidence Indicators** (`High`, `Medium`, `Low`) with transparent rationales.

