## 5. PLATFORM ACCESS & EXECUTION

- **Direct Offline Access**: Open `index.html` directly in any web browser.
- **Local Server**: Running on `http://localhost:3000` via `node server.js`.
- **Export Formats**:
  - Full Executive Partnership Report (22 sections) exportable to **Print / PDF**, **Microsoft Word (.doc)**, **JSON Data**, and **CSV Matrix**.
  - LocalStorage database backup and restore via **JSON**.
- **Multi-Currency Engine**: Live conversion across **PKR** (default), **USD**, **AED**, **GBP**, and **EUR**.
